    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36441" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνωμοτ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνώμοτος</span>) prop. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>band of sworn soldiers</i>: hence, <i>division of
				the Spartan army,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.65
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				6.4.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lac.</u>
				11.4
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόχος</span>
			, cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>; also, <i>a quarter of a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόχος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				6.2
			</span></i>.</div>
